### Feature Product - UPDATE PUT / PATCH (SIN AUTH)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@id = 1

### PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/productos/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro Max",
  "brand": "TechBrand",
  "price": 1499.99,
  "min_stock": 5,
  "quantity": 40,
  "product_type_id": 1
}

### PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/productos/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1399.99,
  "quantity": 45
}